  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/OC1O0Z9C/">
    <dcterms:date>2018-02-12 16:53:18.0</dcterms:date>
    <skos:altLabel></skos:altLabel>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The phrase "integral_wrt_X_of_Y" means int Y dX. The data variable should have an axis for X specifying the limits of the integral as bounds. The phrase "wrt" means "with respect to". "Radioactivity" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. "Radioactivity concentration" means radioactivity per unit volume of the medium. "Pm" means the element "promethium" and "151Pm" is the isotope "promethium-151" with a half-life of 1.18e+00 days.</skos:definition>
    <dcterms:identifier>SDN:P07::OC1O0Z9C</dcterms:identifier>
