    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The phrase "integral_wrt_X_of_Y" means int Y dX. The data variable should have an axis for X specifying the limits of the integral as bounds. The phrase "wrt" means "with respect to". "Radioactivity" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. "Radioactivity concentration" means radioactivity per unit volume of the medium. "Ra" means the element "radium" and "226Ra" is the isotope "radium-226" with a half-life of 5.86e+05 days.</skos:definition>
    <dcterms:date>2018-02-12 16:53:18.0</dcterms:date>
    <skos:altLabel></skos:altLabel>
