    <skos:notation>SDN:P07::CF12N426</skos:notation>
    <dc:identifier>SDN:P07::CF12N426</dc:identifier>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">Mole concentration means number of moles per unit volume, also called "molarity", and is used in the construction mole_concentration_of_X_in_Y, where X is a material constituent of Y.  A chemical species denoted by X may be described by a single term such as 'nitrogen' or a phrase such as 'nox_expressed_as_nitrogen'. The chemical symbol for atomic chlorine is Cl.</skos:definition>
    <skos:note xml:lang="en">accepted</skos:note>
