  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/P07/current/9AHIKJPG/">
    <owl:versionInfo>1</owl:versionInfo>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The phrase "integral_wrt_X_of_Y" means int Y dX. The data variable should have an axis for X specifying the limits of the integral as bounds. The phrase "wrt" means "with respect to". "Radioactivity" means the number of radioactive decays of a material per second. "Radioactivity concentration" means radioactivity per unit volume of the medium. "Th" means the element "thorium" and "233Th" is the isotope "thorium-233" with a half-life of 1.54e-02 days.</skos:definition>
    <dcterms:date>2018-02-12 16:53:18.0</dcterms:date>
    <skos:notation>SDN:P07::9AHIKJPG</skos:notation>
    <skos:prefLabel xml:lang="en">integral_wrt_time_of_radioactivity_concentration_of_233Th_in_air</skos:prefLabel>
    <skos:altLabel></skos:altLabel>
    <owl:deprecated>false</owl:deprecated>
